      "updated": 1784378287385,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Functional Requirements\n- user can login or register\n- user can search movie/show based on title,dates,location\n- user can see the event meta data ( seat, description e.t.c)\n- user should able to do a booking for the event ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Functional Requirements\n- user can login or register\n- user can search movie/show based on title,dates,location\n- user can see the event meta data ( seat, description e.t.c)\n- user should able to do a booking for the event ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
