      "seed": 1730614252,
      "version": 1046,
      "versionNonce": 1630741972,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784378308074,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Non functional requirements\n- scale : 100M daily users\n- highly available when user wants to search & view the events\n- highly consistent when user wants to book a ticket\n\n3. Core Identity\n- User\n- Event(Movie/Show)\n- Venue(Hall/Location)\n- Ticket\n\n4. API Desigining\n- GET /v1/bookMyShow/search?location=kol&eventName=ABC&Dates=08-09-2026\n- GET /v1/bookMyShow/event/{eventId} -> event detaills, available seats, ShowIds[] \n    - return List<EventId> \n- GET /v1/bookMyShow/show/{showId}/seats\n    -return List<SeatId>\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Non functional requirements\n- scale : 100M daily users\n- highly available when user wants to search & view the events\n- highly consistent when user wants to book a ticket\n\n3. Core Identity\n- User\n- Event(Movie/Show)\n- Venue(Hall/Location)\n- Ticket\n\n4. API Desigining\n- GET /v1/bookMyShow/search?location=kol&eventName=ABC&Dates=08-09-2026\n- GET /v1/bookMyShow/event/{eventId} -> event detaills, available seats, ShowIds[] \n    - return List<EventId> \n- GET /v1/bookMyShow/show/{showId}/seats\n    -return List<SeatId>\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
