      "updated": 1784378429994,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- POST /v1/bookMyShow/booking/reserve\n    {\n        List<Seats>\n    }\n    - pass userId in headers\n\n    - response -> return bookingId\n\n- POST /v1/bookMyShow/booking/confirm\n    {\n        bookingId,\n        paymentDetails\n    }\n    - response -> Ticket\n\n- GET /v1/bookMyShow/booking/{bookidId}\n    - return bookingDetaills\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- POST /v1/bookMyShow/booking/reserve\n    {\n        List<Seats>\n    }\n    - pass userId in headers\n\n    - response -> return bookingId\n\n- POST /v1/bookMyShow/booking/confirm\n    {\n        bookingId,\n        paymentDetails\n    }\n    - response -> Ticket\n\n- GET /v1/bookMyShow/booking/{bookidId}\n    - return bookingDetaills\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
