      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784377468930,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Cassandra (Movie/Event Details): Chosen because movie and event metadata is read-heavy, rarely updated, and requires horizontal scalability \n  with high availability, but does not need ACID transactions.\n\n- MySQL (Inventory & Booking): Chosen because seat inventory and bookings require ACID transactions, row-level locking, and strong consistency \n  to prevent double booking.\n\n- Elasticsearch: Chosen because it provides ultra-fast full-text search, autocomplete, typo tolerance, and relevance ranking using an inverted \n  index, which traditional databases are not optimized for.\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Cassandra (Movie/Event Details): Chosen because movie and event metadata is read-heavy, rarely updated, and requires horizontal scalability \n  with high availability, but does not need ACID transactions.\n\n- MySQL (Inventory & Booking): Chosen because seat inventory and bookings require ACID transactions, row-level locking, and strong consistency \n  to prevent double booking.\n\n- Elasticsearch: Chosen because it provides ultra-fast full-text search, autocomplete, typo tolerance, and relevance ranking using an inverted \n  index, which traditional databases are not optimized for.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
